			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> “Very few people will care about this but I wrote it up anyway” is pretty much what I was thinking when I blogged about my CSS reset.  I feel like there must be some law of information sharing where the interest you think people will have is, in general, inversely proportional to the actual interest.</p>",
